The sample represents a clinical trial in Phase1 for patients with Hyperlipidemia. The trial involves the drugs 100 mg inclisiran sodium (equivalent to 94.5 mg inclisiran), 300 mg inclisiran sodium (equivalent to 284 mg inclisiran). The eligibility criteria for inclusion in the trial include Inclusion Criteria:

