The sample represents a clinical trial in Phase1 for patients with Healthy Participants. The trial involves the drugs human interferon alfa 1b inhalation solution, human interferon alfa 1b inhalation solution, human interferon alfa 1b inhalation solution, human interferon alfa 1b inhalation solution. The eligibility criteria for inclusion in the trial include Inclusion Criteria:

